<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>童子-T</songwriter></songwriters><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">回想起和你之间的回忆</text><text for="L2">又会令我落泪 令我感到寂寞</text><text for="L3">曾相信你是我最后的爱情</text><text for="L4">过去在一起的那些时光全都是真实的</text><text for="L5">希望 梦想 还有光明的未来</text><text for="L6">曾经对东京抱有很大的期待</text><text for="L7">但现实却没有那么令人满意</text><text for="L8">凝视着落叶陷入了沉思</text><text for="L9">在那个时候我遇见了你</text><text for="L10">总是得到你的帮助</text><text for="L11">我开始期待打工的时间</text><text for="L12">其实是希望可以和你在同一天轮班</text><text for="L13">意外的你是经常用STAMP的类型（STAMP是LINE的表情图贴）</text><text for="L14">鬼怪和虫子是你害怕的东西</text><text for="L15">一笑鼻子就会皱起来的你是那么可爱</text><text for="L16">失眠的夜晚全都是因为你</text><text for="L17">想立刻向你表白我的心迹</text><text for="L18">但又不想被你发现</text><text for="L19">到底该怎么办才好</text><text for="L20">在自己这样纠结的时候 黎明已经到来</text><text for="L21">像个傻瓜一样沉浸在后悔之中</text><text for="L22">回想起和你之间的回忆</text><text for="L23">又会令我落泪 令我感到寂寞</text><text for="L24">曾相信你是我最后的爱情</text><text for="L25">过去在一起的那些时光全都是真实的</text><text for="L26">在回家路上的公园里接受了你的告白</text><text for="L27">你说的那些腻歪台词让我不禁笑了出来</text><text for="L28">那是我一生都无法忘记的回忆</text><text for="L29">那是你赠与我的珍贵礼物</text><text for="L30">曾经一整天沉迷于游戏里</text><text for="L31">也曾经两个人一起做晚饭</text><text for="L32">我并不向往多么奢侈的生活</text><text for="L33">只要和你在一起就已经足够</text><text for="L34">两个不善言辞的人那次大吵了一架</text><text for="L35">相互拉黑社交账号 故意不接对方电话</text><text for="L36">那时的我未能意识到这样较真的争执</text><text for="L37">其实是多么难能可贵的事情</text><text for="L38">你教会我的事情</text><text for="L39">你赋予我的一切</text><text for="L40">至今仍铭刻在我的心中</text><text for="L41">所以我想和你说声谢谢</text><text for="L42">回想起和你之间的回忆</text><text for="L43">又会令我落泪 令我感到寂寞</text><text for="L44">曾相信你是我最后的爱情</text><text for="L45">过去在一起的那些时光全都是真实的</text><text for="L46">如果我们能够永远都长不大</text><text for="L47">是否能够毫不畏惧继续前行</text><text for="L48">如果我们能够更早地长大成人</text><text for="L49">是否就能够克服一切的难关了</text><text for="L50">如今我依然向夜空中祈求着你的梦境</text><text for="L51">希望如今的你依然和那时一样地笑着</text><text for="L52">希望如今的你</text><text for="L53">依然和那时一样地率直</text><text for="L54">希望如今的你</text><text for="L55">依然和那时一样地温柔</text><text for="L56">希望如今的你</text><text for="L57">可以做你自己</text><text for="L58">不要改变</text><text for="L59">回想起和你之间的回忆</text><text for="L60">又会令我落泪 令我感到寂寞</text><text for="L61">曾相信你是我最后的爱情</text><text for="L62">过去在一起的那些时光全都是真实的</text><text for="L63">回想起和你之间的回忆</text><text for="L64">今晚依旧不禁想要哭泣</text><text for="L65">我依然无比寂寞 痛苦不已</text><text for="L66">曾相信你是我最后的爱情</text><text for="L67">过去在一起的那些时光全都是真实的</text><text for="L68">就算已经分开 我也希望你可以幸福</text><text for="L69">回想起和你之间的回忆</text><text for="L70">今晚依旧不禁想要哭泣</text><text for="L71">我依然无比寂寞 痛苦不已</text><text for="L72">曾相信你是我最后的爱情</text><text for="L73">过去在一起的那些时光全都是真实的</text><text for="L74">就算已经分开 我也希望你可以幸福</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata><amll:meta key="musicName" value="願い〜あの頃のキミへ〜"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="MIREI"/><amll:meta key="album" value="願い E.P."/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1538281338"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPU901701916"/></metadata></head><body><div begin="0:14.865" end="5:10.383"><p begin="0:14.865" end="0:20.244" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:14.865" end="0:15.593">二</span><span begin="0:15.593" end="0:15.993">人</span><span begin="0:15.993" end="0:16.161">の</span><span begin="0:16.161" end="0:16.656">思</span><span begin="0:16.656" end="0:17.000">い</span><span begin="0:17.000" end="0:17.738">出</span> <span begin="0:17.738" end="0:18.073">か</span><span begin="0:18.073" end="0:18.463">き</span><span begin="0:18.463" end="0:18.978">集</span><span begin="0:18.978" end="0:19.192">め</span><span begin="0:19.192" end="0:19.504">た</span><span begin="0:19.504" end="0:20.244">なら</span></p><p begin="0:20.556" end="0:25.993" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:20.556" end="0:21.253">また</span><span begin="0:21.253" end="0:21.601">泣</span><span begin="0:21.601" end="0:21.785">け</span><span begin="0:21.785" end="0:21.993">て</span><span begin="0:21.993" end="0:22.321">き</span><span begin="0:22.321" end="0:22.525">ち</span><span begin="0:22.525" end="0:22.729">ゃ</span><span begin="0:22.729" end="0:23.400">う</span> <span begin="0:23.400" end="0:24.105">寂</span><span begin="0:24.105" end="0:24.521">し</span><span begin="0:24.521" end="0:24.697">さ</span><span begin="0:24.697" end="0:25.217">溢</span><span begin="0:25.217" end="0:25.545">れ</span><span begin="0:25.545" end="0:25.993">て</span></p><p begin="0:26.266" end="0:31.693" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:26.266" end="0:26.986">最</span><span begin="0:26.986" end="0:27.361">後</span><span begin="0:27.361" end="0:27.530">の</span><span begin="0:27.530" end="0:28.033">恋</span><span begin="0:28.033" end="0:28.345">だ</span><span begin="0:28.345" end="0:29.074">と</span> <span begin="0:29.074" end="0:29.805">信</span><span begin="0:29.805" end="0:30.213">じ</span><span begin="0:30.213" end="0:30.389">て</span><span begin="0:30.389" end="0:30.906">願</span><span begin="0:30.906" end="0:31.223">っ</span><span begin="0:31.223" end="0:31.693">た</span></p><p begin="0:31.990" end="0:37.568" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:31.990" end="0:32.610">あの</span><span begin="0:32.610" end="0:33.010">日</span><span begin="0:33.010" end="0:33.178">々</span><span begin="0:33.178" end="0:33.716">に</span><span begin="0:33.716" end="0:34.107">ウソ</span><span begin="0:34.107" end="0:34.413">は</span><span begin="0:34.413" end="0:35.152">な</span><span begin="0:35.152" end="0:35.324">か</span><span begin="0:35.324" end="0:35.496">っ</span><span begin="0:35.496" end="0:37.568">た</span></p><p begin="0:41.018" end="0:43.643" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:41.018" end="0:41.562">希望</span> <span begin="0:41.738" end="0:42.442">夢</span> <span begin="0:42.442" end="0:43.094">明るい</span><span begin="0:43.094" end="0:43.643">未来</span></p><p begin="0:43.963" end="0:46.514" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:43.963" end="0:44.635">東京</span><span begin="0:44.635" end="0:44.803">に</span><span begin="0:44.803" end="0:45.325">持った</span><span begin="0:45.325" end="0:45.997">大きな</span><span begin="0:45.997" end="0:46.514">期待</span></p><p begin="0:46.771" end="0:49.385" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:46.771" end="0:47.309">だけど</span><span begin="0:47.309" end="0:47.979">現実</span><span begin="0:47.979" end="0:48.180">は</span><span begin="0:48.180" end="0:49.385">甘くなくて</span></p><p begin="0:49.628" end="0:52.530" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:49.628" end="0:50.153">落ち葉</span><span begin="0:50.153" end="0:50.730">見つめ</span> <span begin="0:50.730" end="0:51.258">深く</span><span begin="0:51.258" end="0:52.530">思い詰めてた</span></p><p begin="0:52.809" end="0:55.437" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:52.809" end="0:53.367">そんな</span><span begin="0:53.367" end="0:53.727">とき</span><span begin="0:53.727" end="0:53.842">に</span><span begin="0:53.842" end="0:54.403">あなた</span><span begin="0:54.403" end="0:54.576">と</span><span begin="0:54.576" end="0:54.769">出</span><span begin="0:54.769" end="0:54.915">会</span><span begin="0:54.915" end="0:55.061">っ</span><span begin="0:55.061" end="0:55.437">て</span></p><p begin="0:55.661" end="0:58.199" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:55.661" end="0:56.201">いつも</span><span begin="0:56.201" end="0:56.742">あなた</span><span begin="0:56.742" end="0:56.933">に</span><span begin="0:56.933" end="0:58.199">助けられて</span></p><p begin="0:58.463" end="1:00.736" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:58.463" end="0:59.039">バイト</span><span begin="0:59.039" end="0:59.216">が</span><span begin="0:59.216" end="0:59.920">楽しみ</span><span begin="0:59.920" end="1:00.080">に</span><span begin="1:00.080" end="1:00.215">な</span><span begin="1:00.215" end="1:00.350">っ</span><span begin="1:00.350" end="1:00.736">て</span></p><p begin="1:00.968" end="1:03.839" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.968" end="1:01.496">実は</span><span begin="1:01.496" end="1:02.040">シフト</span><span begin="1:02.040" end="1:02.587">被る</span><span begin="1:02.587" end="1:02.759">よう</span><span begin="1:02.759" end="1:02.946">に</span><span begin="1:02.946" end="1:03.839">狙ってた</span></p><p begin="1:04.139" end="1:06.715" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.139" end="1:04.837">スタンプ</span><span begin="1:04.837" end="1:05.357">使い</span><span begin="1:05.357" end="1:05.525">が</span><span begin="1:05.525" end="1:05.853">妙に</span><span begin="1:05.853" end="1:06.715">うまくて</span></p><p begin="1:07.019" end="1:09.612" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.019" end="1:07.563">お化け</span><span begin="1:07.563" end="1:07.747">も</span><span begin="1:07.747" end="1:08.115">虫</span><span begin="1:08.115" end="1:08.308">も</span><span begin="1:08.308" end="1:09.612">受け付けなくて</span></p><p begin="1:09.852" end="1:12.443" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.852" end="1:10.564">くしゃくしゃ</span><span begin="1:10.564" end="1:10.750">の</span><span begin="1:10.750" end="1:10.924">笑</span><span begin="1:10.924" end="1:11.300">顔</span><span begin="1:11.300" end="1:11.476">が</span><span begin="1:11.476" end="1:12.443">可愛くて</span></p><p begin="1:12.683" end="1:15.204" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.683" end="1:13.587">眠れない</span><span begin="1:13.587" end="1:13.955">夜</span><span begin="1:13.955" end="1:14.139">は</span><span begin="1:14.139" end="1:14.491">キミ</span><span begin="1:14.491" end="1:14.676">の</span><span begin="1:14.676" end="1:14.942">せい</span><span begin="1:14.942" end="1:15.204">で</span></p><p begin="1:15.451" end="1:18.039" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.451" end="1:15.817">この</span><span begin="1:15.817" end="1:16.353">気持ち</span><span begin="1:16.353" end="1:16.729">今</span><span begin="1:16.729" end="1:17.073">すぐ</span><span begin="1:17.073" end="1:17.258">に</span> <span begin="1:17.258" end="1:17.625">伝</span><span begin="1:17.625" end="1:17.801">え</span><span begin="1:17.801" end="1:18.039">たい</span></p><p begin="1:18.230" end="1:19.428" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.230" end="1:18.576">けど</span><span begin="1:18.576" end="1:18.750">バ</span><span begin="1:18.750" end="1:18.920">レ</span><span begin="1:18.920" end="1:19.087">た</span><span begin="1:19.087" end="1:19.255">く</span><span begin="1:19.255" end="1:19.428">ない</span></p><p begin="1:19.634" end="1:21.055" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.634" end="1:19.826">どう</span><span begin="1:19.826" end="1:20.362">したら</span><span begin="1:20.362" end="1:20.626">いい</span><span begin="1:20.626" end="1:20.954">の</span><span begin="1:20.954" end="1:21.055">?</span></p><p begin="1:21.275" end="1:23.685" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.275" end="1:21.540">迷</span><span begin="1:21.540" end="1:21.651">っ</span><span begin="1:21.651" end="1:21.811">て</span><span begin="1:21.811" end="1:21.918">る</span><span begin="1:21.918" end="1:22.258">うち</span><span begin="1:22.258" end="1:22.410">に</span><span begin="1:22.410" end="1:23.034">夜明け</span><span begin="1:23.034" end="1:23.330">が</span><span begin="1:23.330" end="1:23.685">きて</span></p><p begin="1:23.958" end="1:26.673" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:23.958" end="1:24.322">馬鹿</span><span begin="1:24.322" end="1:24.863">みたい</span><span begin="1:24.863" end="1:25.089">に</span><span begin="1:25.089" end="1:25.332">後</span><span begin="1:25.332" end="1:25.777">悔</span><span begin="1:25.777" end="1:25.905">し</span><span begin="1:25.905" end="1:26.673">て</span></p><p begin="1:26.226" end="1:31.234" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.2